{"server":"cn","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_10_end","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_10","title":"“狼之主”","storyCode":"IS-10","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_10_end.txt","sourceHash":"1f6dc06c303e0272697aa4e03329573b19383bf5149102d60a7dbb38748aca86","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g6_newtown_street"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"扎罗，狼之主之间不是约定好了，不会干涉凡人的事务吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我改变主意了，因为贝纳尔多毁了我的计划！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我苦心培养了他六十八年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而他，竟敢以自尽来葬送我的胜利！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父亲......他自尽了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"莱昂图索的脑中瞬间闪过父亲对狼之主以及这场游戏的解释。\n他猛然明白，父亲在教堂对自己说的那些话，既是对自己的承认——\n同时也是遗言。\n父亲在一开始就做好了自我了结的准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"侮辱狼之主的代价是巨大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便他已经死去，我依然要让他的血脉从此断绝于这片大地之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝纳尔多之子，今天，你必须代替你的父亲付出代价。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这份代价，就是他的血脉，你的性命！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"代价？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说代价？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父亲确实错了，但他理想的根源，却始终是改变这个时代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他渴望着一个没有家族的叙拉古，并为此谋划了一生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原以为，父亲只是将自己的家族作为筹码。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为他在此刻发难，只因为时机正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在，我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他觉得没有时间了，错过这个机会，他就再也无法在实现自己理想的同时，完成对你的复仇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在他短暂的一生中，对他倾囊相授，换来的却是他的背叛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不会明白的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高高在上，自以为掌控一切的狼之主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父亲甚至将自己的性命，也作为了筹码。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使以自己的性命为代价，即使是违抗你这个傲慢的存在，他也要将自己的理想付诸现实！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该为此付出代价的是你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无知！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯，欢迎回来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你那边搞定了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该解决这边的麻烦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后的德克萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要忘记，当年是谁许诺你可以离开叙拉古的掌控。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，你竟敢忤逆我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经完成了与贝纳尔多的约定，我不再欠你什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愚昧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......贝纳尔多，自尽了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i15"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"游戏结束了，拉维妮娅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，这就是你那句话真正的含义......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个没有家族的叙拉古，这就是你真正的理想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么，不告诉我呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小法官，战斗的时候怎么能分心呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉普兰德——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，这么有趣的战斗，不叫上我也太不够意思了，德克萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正你会来的，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，你说得也对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"离群的幼狼，闪开，这里没有你的立足之地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉你一个好消息吧，狼之主，或者狼之子，还是什么东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从现在起，叙拉古的一切，都将是我的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是你这种超出常人的存在，也不例外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狂妄！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首领......你也是吗，如果你站在我的面前，你也会像莱昂这样，决绝地告诉我，你会选择你的理想吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......我已经不知道答案了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不想死的话，就集中精神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿涅塞的獠牙，弱小的獠牙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为你窥探了我的獠牙之死，就可以站在我的面前了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我答应了贝纳尔多，我会帮助他的子嗣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿涅塞培养出了一个软弱的獠牙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我就在这里，让她也退出这场游戏吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论你们做什么，你们都无法毁灭我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们甚至无法伤到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人类，你们建起城市，将自己关入其中，自以为是这片大地的主人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过是学会了摆弄一些工具，别太自以为是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们从未征服荒野。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"女士们，先生们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"现在向你们走来的，是龙门的超级巨星，也就是我，大帝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老板？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"我必须提醒你，德克萨斯，你的假期快要结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你怎么也来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你问我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你走了之后，空她们也跟着跑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"这一个月来你知道我是怎么过的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"我感觉我过去三千年都没有这么无聊过！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"根本没人跟我开派对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大帝——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"别急，扎罗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你又要说，我无权在叙拉古干涉你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，我一点也不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我仔细想了想，比起和你进行一场毫无意义的厮杀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"用你们的规矩打败你，能更让我解气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"所以——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i05"},{"type":"narration","text":"一条又一条的暗影自大帝脚下蔓延，并最终凝聚成一个又一个的实体。\n扎罗当然认识他们，他们都是已经在这一轮的游戏中落败的狼之主。\n他们出现在这里，只有一个理由。\n他破坏了规则。\n他们接受他的游戏方式，但不能允许规则被打破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，我特意找来了其他闲得发慌的狼之主们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"向你宣布一个好消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"我亲爱的朋友，你失败了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，败得很彻底。"},{"type":"narration","text":"狼之主永生不灭，然而，漫长的岁月中，狼之主们早已找到了牵制，压制，甚至折磨彼此的方法。\n面对诸多与自己相同的存在，扎罗知道，自己的行为已经再无意义。\n他沉默半晌，终于低下了高傲的头颅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g6_newtown_street"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"说实在的，扎罗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你自以为了解权力、玩弄权力的样子，让我觉得浑身发痒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"反而是现在的你，恼羞成怒，想要把一切违抗你的东西全部撕碎的样子，更让我觉得——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你确实没有违背你的本性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，你们其他狼也是，这么一个无聊的游戏玩了几千年真的不会腻吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你们应该来龙门跟我学一学怎么打扑克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，麻将也不错。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"扎罗没有理会大帝的讥讽。\n他只是最后深深看了一眼莱昂图索，然后，他的身影不断模糊，模糊，最终，消散在风中。\n像是他从未存在过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，老板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"谢我就算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"实际上，就算我不出手，也会有人出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"她只是把这场好戏让给了我而已，我说得对吧，美女。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被称作美女，倒是很久没有过的经历了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不介意的话，你可以在叙拉古玩上一段时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以叫我大帝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有趣的名字，你不像那些狼之主，傲慢又无知，叙拉古欢迎你，大帝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信，叙拉古会喜欢我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西西里夫人——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狼之主之间的游戏落后而又可笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贝纳尔多的儿子，莱昂图索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以放心，他未来也不会再打扰你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"莱昂图索不敢动弹。\n在老人出现的瞬间，他立刻意识到了一件事——结束了。\n不仅仅是狼之主带来的闹剧，他们的反抗，也到此为止。\n眼前的老人和蔼可亲，一股预感却在他心中油然而生——如果他轻举妄动，那么，下一秒，他就会以最悲惨的方式死去。\n但他同样知道，如果他此时退缩，那此前的一切努力与信念，都将成为泡影。\n他看向拉维妮娅，他从拉维妮娅的眼中看到了同样的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，西西里夫人，我想过无数种与您面对面的形式，唯独没有想过这种。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您或许已经了解发生了什么，您或许已经有了决断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但无论如何，我依然希望，您能给我和拉维妮娅一个机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"机会，什么样的机会？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对话的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使我们的命运最终是死亡，我也想在死前，让您听一听我们的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿格尼尔总是让我多接触一下年轻人的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看他是把自己想得太老了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我来吧，孩子们，你们已经为自己赢得了这个机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可以等我一下吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之前，我想先去看一看贝纳尔多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无妨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g6_newtown_street"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"能天使，德克萨斯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们没事吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事没事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们怎么来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"我还是放心不下你这边，而且乔万娜小姐的伤势也稳定了，我就和可颂赶过来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，不过，看起来你们这边好像有种结束的感觉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......虽然感觉好像还差点什么，不过，我们总算可以举办派对了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们先聊一聊，想要什么样的派对吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯，你要去哪儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上个厕所。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g6_newtown_street"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厕所可不在这个方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是感觉松了一口气，觉得总算是告一段落了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼前不就还有一桩大麻烦么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。走走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g5_srcpark"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，德克萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你回到叙拉古之前，其实我收到过一封来自西西里夫人的信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你猜上面写了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没兴趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真没意思。西西里夫人在上面邀请我成为巨狼之口的一员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨狼之口......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无非是让我成为她圈养的狼罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我把那封信烧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本以为，又要被叙拉古来的家伙烦一阵子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结果没想到，你突然返回了叙拉古。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道当我发现你已经走了的时候，有多惊讶吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你已经决定了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会留下来，帮助拉维妮娅和莱昂图索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说，你在自己家族大闹了一场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是去和父亲道了个别而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......德克萨斯，你是不是其实不知道，我究竟在你身上追求着什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我有时候以为自己知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但有时候又觉得，我并不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道，你看起来，比之前看开了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？你还会关心我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对我来说，你只是有点烦人而已。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"原本并肩同行的两人，像是心有灵犀一般，走到了空旷处的两端。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兜兜转转到最后，我们之间，果然还是要有这么一场啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还记得吗，德克萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"七年前，被烈火包围的豪宅之前，你走向了我，为了离开这一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那天，我输得体无完肤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而七年后，细雨连绵的公园之中，你再次走向了我，这一次，却是为了向叙拉古这个国家发起无谋的挑战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天，我会杀了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原话奉还。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i10"},{"type":"narration","text":"兵器碰撞的声音在公园中不断响起。\n两人的招式都毫无花哨可言，招招都旨在直取对方性命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"用一种诗意的比喻来描述的话，我是你的过去，德克萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因为我是如此地相信，没有人可以逃离这座泥潭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你曾经一度逃离了你的过去，并在重返叙拉古后，决心彻底与过去断绝关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你向所有人证明了，你有能力和资格摆脱这座泥潭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你甚至为了帮助那头幼狼改变这座泥潭，而主动留在了这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有你说的那么伟大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的梦想，从一开始就只是，和几个要好的朋友，过一种简单的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有人要破坏它，那我就会保卫它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么复杂的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一直以来，我都没有真正认识你，切利尼娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有发现你对于叙拉古的厌倦，也没有察觉到你对于哥伦比亚的反感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在想想，我就像我奶奶一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实际上，她这一生都在等待着萨尔瓦多雷爷爷能够回心转意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"却从未尝试过去问一问，去争取一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是，我总是理所当然地以为，曾经的美好时光将会永远延续。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在看来，我是多么傲慢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定不会介意我留在你身边，我也很想再和空多聊一聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，现在的我，还没有这个资格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以至少，此时此刻，让我为《德克萨斯之死》第三幕，关于切利尼娜·德克萨斯的结局，画上句号吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是如此自由，切利尼娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有人能够定义你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，让我换一个说法吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯，你是我的梦魇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你总是出乎我的意料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你永远先我一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你做出了每一个我无法做出的决断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而直到现在，当我终于像你一样，迈出了那一步，我才终于能将这些说出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你说得对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没什么复杂的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然我痛恨叙拉古的一切，那我就应当去砸碎它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"结果，最终还是你，让我走出了这一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你才与你的父亲道了别，而且，站在了我的面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想要和你的过去做个了结。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，就和你一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们本不必互相厮杀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但这一切就是发生了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"时至今日，我们不约而同地明白，将对方杀死，是对自己的总结。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是对对方的馈赠，以及最好的道别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而活下来的那个人，将会变得更强大。"},{"type":"narration","text":"绝不是拉普兰德变得比德克萨斯强了，又或者说，德克萨斯变弱了。\n正如七年前的那场对决，拉普兰德也不是因为弱于德克萨斯而惨败。\n她们的实力，从一开始就旗鼓相当。\n决定她们之间胜负的，除了一些运气因素，只有——意志。\n七年前，拉普兰德输在了意志之上。\n而在与家族诀别之后，她在意志力上也已经不输于德克萨斯。\n于是，她们之间，谁都有可能赢，也谁都有可能输。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g5_srcpark"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结束了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别过来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"德克萨斯看了空一眼，旋即缓缓闭上了眼。\n拉普兰德以为自己已经足够了解德克萨斯了。\n她还有什么不知道的呢？\n她见证了德克萨斯对叙拉古的厌倦，又目睹了她决定与这个国家开战的果决。\n每一次，德克萨斯的选择都出乎了她的意料。\n但这一次，她以为，不会有了。\n你死我活，没有别的结局。\n然而，这一刻，当她看到德克萨斯眼中的不舍时，她又一次发现，自己错了。\n在最后的最后，在名为拉普兰德的存在为自己设计的终局之中，德克萨斯又一次出乎了她的意料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈，原来如此。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉普兰德将这场厮杀视作一种诀别，一种解放。\n如果她输了，那么，她将接受自己的死亡。\n但是，如果她赢了，她将不再有任何挂念，任何束缚。\n当名为“德克萨斯”的楔子也从她的精神中被拔去的那一瞬间，一个名为“拉普兰德”的狂人，将真正诞生。\n然而，这一切终究没有发生。\n因为——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯，原来，你只是德克萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然只是德克萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，我也只是拉普兰德。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉普兰德向德克萨斯伸出了手。\n德克萨斯握住了这只手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯，我是你的朋友，还是你的敌人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你既是我的朋友，也是我的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就让我做一点，朋友该做的事吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"德克萨斯向着其他三人点了点头，然后，与拉普兰德一同，向着灰厅的方向走去。\n一切是那么地自然，仿佛事情本该如此。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g6_laterano_chapelin"},{"type":"narration","text":"直到拉维妮娅走进教堂，看到那具静静坐在长椅上的尸体时，她才终于相信——\n贝纳尔多死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她坐在这个亦严父亦长兄，影响了她一生的人身边，沉默良久。\n她终于还是什么都没有说。\n最终，她握住贝纳尔多垂下的手，似是向他传达了什么，又或是从他那里获得了什么。\n然后，转身离开。\n斯人已逝，而她只能继续前进。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g9_conferencehall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听朋友讲述了你的所作所为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，我想问一问你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今，这片大地上的诸多国家都在顺应时代，寻求变革。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，寻求变革的初衷，是意识到自身有所不足，或者是寻求突破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叙拉古当真存在这个需求吗，叙拉古，真的需要改变吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......认为家族是理所应当存在的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有理所应当的存在，只是，它在我出生以前，就已经在这片土地上存在了千百年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们无法否定历史，更无法轻易地粉碎已经存在的事物，不是吗，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以您在建立灰厅时，选择了延续家族的体系，只是，所有家族都必须在您的掌控下运转。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并没有否定这一点的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相反，我认为您的选择在当时很正确。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而在现在不正确？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥伦比亚家族的回流，带回了先进的技术，同时还有先进的思想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家族形式的统治，已经逐渐被哥伦比亚人撬动，而许多人尚且还不自知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父亲的做法，我必须承认，其中有偏激的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的想法出发点和我并不相同，因此，我们的手段也天差地别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，有一点是相同的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都认为——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叙拉古不再需要家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你又打算怎么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......最简单的方法，恐怕是在这里与您决一生死吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，这是我父亲会做的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想向您借一座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很有魅力的提案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一座新的城市，确实应当注入一些新的血液。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，孩子，你只是孤身一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要如何相信，你能够完成你的目标？"},{"type":"narration","text":"西西里夫人的话音未落，灰厅的大门就被推开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切利尼娜，最后的德克萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过来，让我好好看一看你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你和你爷爷长得很像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，乔万娜将我给她的项链转交给了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有什么愿望？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你想回到龙门，我可以答应你，叙拉古将不会再打扰你的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望，你能放过罗塞蒂家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？这倒是出乎了我的预料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦拉赫刺杀了乔万娜，还几次三番想要置你于死地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你当真愿意放过他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们也只不过是在以他们的方式生存。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原本就不打算对他们出手，所以，你可以留着这串项链。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，你可以用来交换，永远离开叙拉古的权利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"德克萨斯走到莱昂图索身边缓缓坐下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暂时没有这个必要了，我打算延长一下我的假期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，拉普兰德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"离群的孤狼，萨卢佐的叛徒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉普兰德嬉笑着走到德克萨斯的身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我的想法没有那么复杂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和他们都想要毁掉现在的叙拉古。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯一的区别是，我的手段没有那么文明。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉维妮娅法官，我意志的代理人，你又作何看法？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉维妮娅径直走到莱昂图索的背后站定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的意志曾是叙拉古的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但从现在开始，我会去改变它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你认为我是错误的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是相信，人无法永远正确。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i11"},{"type":"narration","text":"西西里夫人看着眼前的四个青年。\n一个人，出身叙拉古最为强大的家族，被周遭环境影响，对文明心生向往，却囿于身份而不得其法，于是选择了掩耳盗铃。\n一个人，出身平凡，机缘巧合得到了家族的支持得以生存，却也因此而陷入了对自己的怀疑，于是选择了欺骗自己。\n一个人，出身于叙拉古最古老的家族，却痛恨被强加在身上的，有关这片土地的一切，于是选择了状若癫狂的反抗。\n一个人，出身于哥伦比亚最强盛的家族，却对家族的形式从根本上感到厌倦，于是选择了无声的逃离。\n他们想要改变叙拉古的理由各不相同，然而，最终，他们聚集到了一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的寿命并非永恒，但我还有几十年的时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我闭上双眼的那一瞬间之前，叙拉古都将享受我所带来的安宁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你呢，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你站在你父亲的肩膀上，追寻着一个更高效，更公平的体制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我，你认为，你选择的道路就是正确的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我真的将叙拉古交给你，你能保证，叙拉古一定能够走上更好的道路，成为一个更好的国家吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不能保证。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但正如您今天愿意坐在这里听我的想法一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果到时候，又有新的人想要来颠覆我的做法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也会坐下来，听一听他的想法。"},{"type":"narration","text":"西西里夫人笑了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g6_newtown_street"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，我就跟你说嘛，里面又没传来打打杀杀的声音，他们不会有事的啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"也只有你会这么心大了，那可是这个国家的领导者欸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，各位，让你们担心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，拉普兰德......呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"德克萨斯将视线投向某个方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她已经完成了身为朋友的使命，谁知道她下一次，又会以什么样的面貌出现在我们面前呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我唯一能肯定的是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她还会出现在我们面前的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，想想都好麻烦啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"算啦。比起这个，我们先去乔万娜小姐那里看一看她的情况吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"乔万娜小姐，我们回来了！"},{"type":"narration","text":"房间里空无一人。\n空的喜悦迅速转变为了困惑。\n但她马上发现，桌子上整齐地摆放着一叠纸。\n那是一份剧本。\n空翻开第一页，上面写着——\n这份剧本送给我亲爱的老朋友，切利尼娜。\n以及新朋友，企鹅物流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"这是《德克萨斯之死》第三幕里，乔万娜小姐一直都没有灵感的情节......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"乔万娜小姐，这就是你留给我们的东西吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"明明，你不用离开的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["空"]},{"speakerId":"char_105_emper","aliases":["大帝"]}]}
